%% Mermaid diagram describing the CodeUse demo architecture.
flowchart LR
    subgraph Orchestration
        O1[Check & Prompt Generator]
        O2[IDE Agent]
        O1 -->|Fix Intent| O2
    end

    subgraph Execution
        E1[tool.py CLI]
        E2[Executor Sandbox]
        E3[runs/ JSON Artifacts]
        E1 -->|Launch job| E2
        E2 -->|Persist result| E3
    end

    subgraph Reporting
        R1[reporter.load_runs]
        R2[reporter.generate_report]
        R3[Markdown Table]
        R4[HTML Gallery]
        R1 --> R2 --> R3
        R2 --> R4
    end

    Orchestration -->|ExecutionRequest| Execution
    Execution -->|RunSummary| Reporting
    Reporting -->|Demo Output| Orchestration
